(PRINCESS & BROTHERS?) Tj
T*
(PROJECT DOCUMENTATION?) Tj
T*
(Updated: October 2026?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(OVERVIEW?) Tj
T*
(Princess & Brothers is a full-stack produce storefront and operations platform. It?) Tj
T*
(is built as a TypeScript monorepo with a Next.js App Router web application, MySQL?) Tj
T*
(database, and shared database and UI workspaces.?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(TECHNOLOGY?) Tj
T*
(- Node.js 20 or newer and npm workspaces?) Tj
T*
(- Next.js 15, React 18, and TypeScript?) Tj
T*
(- MySQL 8 using parameterized mysql2 queries?) Tj
T*
(- Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap, and custom responsive CSS?) Tj
T*
(- Vitest for unit and integration tests?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(REPOSITORY MAP?) Tj
T*
(- frontend/app: Next.js pages, layouts, API routes, sitemap, and server actions?) Tj
T*
(- frontend/features: storefront, authentication, admin, driver, contributor,?) Tj
T*
(payment, and privacy feature code?) Tj
T*
(- frontend/shared: shared server utilities?) Tj
T*
(- db: schema, migrations, seed scripts, and database smoke tests?) Tj
T*
(- packages/db: shared typed database package?) Tj
T*
(- packages/ui: shared UI package?) Tj
T*
(- scripts: local development preflight checks?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(LOCAL DEVELOPMENT?) Tj
T*
(Requirements: Node.js 20+, npm 10+, and MySQL 8.?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(1. Create a MySQL database named princesbrothers and start MySQL on the host and?) Tj
T*
(port configured in DATABASE_URL \(the default is 127.0.0.1:3306\).?) Tj
T*
(2. Install packages from the repository root with: npm install?) Tj
T*
(3. Copy .env.example to .env and configure DATABASE_URL and AUTH_JWT_SECRET.?) Tj
T*
(AUTH_JWT_SECRET must contain at least 32 characters.?) Tj
T*
(4. Apply the database schema with: npm run db:migrate?) Tj
T*
(5. Optionally load starter catalog data with: npm run db:seed?) Tj
T*
(6. Start development with: npm run dev?) Tj
T*
(7. Open: http://localhost:3000?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(The root development command checks that MySQL is reachable before starting.?) Tj
T*
(The web workspace may be run directly with?) Tj
T*
("npm run dev --workspace=@princess-brothers/web", but data-backed features still?) Tj
T*
(require MySQL.?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(IMPORTANT COMMANDS?) Tj
T*
(- npm run dev: preflight and start the web application?) Tj
T*
(- npm run build: production build?) Tj
T*
(- npm run lint: run available workspace linters?) Tj
T*
(- npm run typecheck: typecheck web, database, and UI workspaces?) Tj
T*
(- npm test: run Vitest tests?) Tj
T*
(- npm run db:migrate: apply schema and migrations?) Tj
T*
(- npm run db:seed: load initial database data?) Tj
T*
ET
