T*
(PUBLIC ROUTES AND FEATURES?) Tj
T*
(- /: produce storefront and product/category highlights?) Tj
T*
(- /products: searchable and filterable product catalog?) Tj
T*
(- /products/{id}: product details?) Tj
T*
(- /cart and /checkout: basket and checkout?) Tj
T*
(- /login: customer log in, account creation, and Google sign-in?) Tj
T*
(- /account and /orders: customer account and order history?) Tj
T*
(- /privacy-policy and /terms-and-conditions: published policy pages?) Tj
T*
(- /sitemap.xml: generated public-route sitemap, including active catalog products?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(The header includes account sign-in/sign-up choices, an account-management link,?) Tj
T*
(cart access, contributor/driver shortcuts, and a light/dark theme button. The theme?) Tj
T*
(choice is held in sessionStorage, so it remains for the current browser tab?) Tj
T*
(session and is not saved as a permanent preference.?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(DRIVER PORTAL?) Tj
T*
(Drivers sign in at /driver/login and use /driver for their dashboard. The dashboard?) Tj
T*
(shows the logged-in driver's assigned deliveries for today, recipient/address?) Tj
T*
(details, route navigation, and delivery progress. Drivers can update delivery?) Tj
T*
(status and manage their own vehicle details, service locations, and payout?) Tj
T*
(accounts. Server actions verify an active driver session and scope reads/writes?) Tj
T*
(to that driver's database record; one driver cannot edit another driver's routes?) Tj
T*
(or settings.?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(OTHER PORTALS?) Tj
T*
(- /partner: contributor access and application?) Tj
T*
(- /partner/dashboard: contributor dashboard for authorized contributors?) Tj
T*
(- /admin/dashboard: administration?) Tj
T*
(- /login/admin: administrator sign-in?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(Accountant admins can access the private income/expense ledger and reports.?) Tj
T*
(Ledger visibility is restricted to the accountant account that recorded each?) Tj
T*
(transaction. Apply the current migrations before using the finance workflow.?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(AUTHENTICATION AND CONFIGURATION?) Tj
T*
(Authentication uses httpOnly session cookies and MySQL-backed session state.?) Tj
T*
(Storefront accounts support password and Google sign-in. Drivers use a phone?) Tj
T*
(number and PIN. Admin accounts use password and TOTP. Contributors are subject?) Tj
T*
(to verification and approval. Keep provider credentials and signing secrets in?) Tj
T*
(.env or the deployment secret manager; never commit credentials.?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(For local Google OAuth, register this exact authorized redirect URI in the Google?) Tj
T*
(Cloud Console and set GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI to the same value:?) Tj
T*
(http://localhost:3000/api/auth/google/callback?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(Common configuration variables are documented in .env.example and DEPLOYMENT.md.?) Tj
T*
(Provider credentials are needed only for enabled services such as Google OAuth,?) Tj
T*
(SMS, email, or payment gateways.?) Tj
T*
(?) Tj
T*
(DEPLOYMENT AND OPERATIONS?) Tj
T*
